; The binding: the primitives a game describes a world with, the HOST that turns
; a committed description into a World, and the loop that will drive it. In
; React's terms this is react-dom, and camlcast is the DOM.
;
; The only library that depends on both, and deliberately the only one. loom
; knows nothing of walls; camlcast knows nothing of components; everything that
; has to know both is here, where it can be read in one sitting.

(library
 (name camlcast_stage)
 (public_name camlcast.stage)
 (libraries camlcast camlcast_loom))
